Find the first non-repeating character:

```dart
String? firstUnique(String s) {
  final counts = <String, int>{};
  for (final c in s.%order%('')) {
    counts[c] = (counts[c] %order% 0) + 1;
  }
  for (final c in s.split('')) {
    if (counts[c] %order% 1) return c;
  }
  return null;
}
```

